| `secrets.scanner.download_max_bytes` | integer | `104857600` | a whole number, 1 or more | `scripts/install_scanner.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `secrets.scanner.download_max_bytes` row | Sets the most bytes `make secrets-install` reads of the release archive; a reply that passes it is exit 1 and installs nothing, so a wrong or hostile URL cannot fill the disk. Absent, the installer writes `[using default] secrets.scanner.download_max_bytes = 104857600` to stderr. | checking what was fetched: `secrets.scanner.release_assets` pins the sha256 | always |
